### 智慧城市交通系统 - 接口测试（IDEA HTTP Client，直接点绿色箭头运行）

### 1. 注册（重复用户名会返回 400）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "test01",
  "password": "123456",
  "nickname": "测试用户"
}

### 2. 登录（成功后自动把 access/refresh 令牌存入全局变量）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "123456"
}

> {%
client.global.set("access_token", response.body.data.accessToken);
client.global.set("refresh_token", response.body.data.refreshToken);
%}

### 3. 获取当前登录用户信息（携带访问令牌）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### 4. 刷新令牌（旧 refresh 作废，新令牌写回变量）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refresh_token}}"
}

> {%
client.global.set("access_token", response.body.data.accessToken);
client.global.set("refresh_token", response.body.data.refreshToken);
%}

### 5. 不带令牌访问受保护接口（预期返回 401）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/auth/me

### 6. 退出登录（注销访问令牌与刷新令牌）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "refreshToken": "{{refresh_token}}"
}

### 7. 退出后再用旧令牌访问（预期 401，验证 Redis 已删除）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

# ==========================================================
# 售票模块：乘车人 + 余票查询（B2 统一库存）
# 先执行上面的「登录」拿到 access_token，再跑下面的请求
# ==========================================================

### 8. 新增乘车人（乘车人一）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/passengers
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "passengerName": "张三",
  "idCard": "610101199001011234",
  "passengerType": 1
}

> {%
client.global.set("passenger_id", response.body.data.id);
%}

### 9. 重复添加同一身份证（预期 400：该身份证号已存在乘车人）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/passengers
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "passengerName": "张三",
  "idCard": "610101199001011234",
  "passengerType": 1
}

### 10. 新增乘车人（乘车人二，用于多乘车人下单）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/passengers
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "passengerName": "李四",
  "idCard": "610101199002022345",
  "passengerType": 1
}

> {%
client.global.set("passenger_id_2", response.body.data.id);
%}

### 11. 查询我的乘车人列表（身份证应已脱敏）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/passengers
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### 12. 统一预热 G1001 全部席别（先 DEL 旧 key，再写 stock Hash，6 条区段）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders/preheat?trainNo=G1001
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### 13. 查余票：西安北→宝鸡南 全程二等座（第一次 data.source 应为 REDIS）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/ticket/remain?trainNo=G1001&fromSeq=1&toSeq=3&seatNo=SECOND_CLASS
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### 14. 再查一次同一区间（1 秒内 data.source 应为 LOCAL，验证本地缓存）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/ticket/remain?trainNo=G1001&fromSeq=1&toSeq=3&seatNo=SECOND_CLASS
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### 15. 查余票：咸阳秦都→宝鸡南 二等座（单区段，直接取该 field）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/ticket/remain?trainNo=G1001&fromSeq=2&toSeq=3&seatNo=SECOND_CLASS
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### 16. 查不存在的车次（预期 400，验证缓存空值防穿透）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/ticket/remain?trainNo=G9999&fromSeq=1&toSeq=3&seatNo=SECOND_CLASS
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

# ==========================================================
# 抢票下单（先记账后动钱：写流水 → 扣Redis → 建订单 → 扣DB库存）
# 顺序：执行 sql/05_b2_unified_stock.sql → 预热 → 下单 → 查状态
# ==========================================================

### 17. 抢票成功（乘车人一，G1001 二等座全程，预期 status=已确认）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "passengerId": {{passenger_id}},
  "trainNo": "G1001",
  "seatNo": "SECOND_CLASS",
  "fromSeq": 1,
  "toSeq": 3
}

> {%
client.global.set("order_no", response.body.data.orderNo);
%}

### 18. 按订单号查状态（预期 已确认）
GET http://localhost:8080/api/orders/{{order_no}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}

### 19. 同一乘车人换席别再下单（预期 400：判重不分席别，该乘车人已买此车次）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "passengerId": {{passenger_id}},
  "trainNo": "G1001",
  "seatNo": "FIRST_CLASS",
  "fromSeq": 1,
  "toSeq": 2
}

### 20. 另一乘车人单区段下单（多乘车人各买一张，允许，预期成功）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "passengerId": {{passenger_id_2}},
  "trainNo": "G1001",
  "seatNo": "FIRST_CLASS",
  "fromSeq": 2,
  "toSeq": 3
}

### 21. 未预热车次下单（预期 400：库存未预热，流水已取消，不回补）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "passengerId": {{passenger_id_2}},
  "trainNo": "G9999",
  "seatNo": "SECOND_CLASS",
  "fromSeq": 1,
  "toSeq": 3
}

### 22. 删除乘车人
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/passengers/{{passenger_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{access_token}}
